    <!-- About / Privacy / Licenses -->
    <string name="privacy_policy_title">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_body">AutoPlay does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data. All preferences are stored locally on your device. The app requires the following permissions:\n\n• FOREGROUND_SERVICE / FOREGROUND_SERVICE_MEDIA_PLAYBACK — to run a persistent background service that detects headphone connections\n• RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED — to restart the service after device reboot\n• MODIFY_AUDIO_SETTINGS — to monitor audio device changes\n• REQUEST_IGNORE_BATTERY_OPTIMIZATIONS — optional, to request exemption from battery optimization for reliable operation\n\nNo analytics, crash reporting, or network requests are made by this app.</string>
    <string name="licenses_title">Open Source Licenses</string>
    <string name="licenses_body">This app includes the following open source libraries:\n\n• AndroidX libraries (Apache 2.0)\n• Google Material Components (Apache 2.0)\n• Kotlin Standard Library (Apache 2.0)\n• Robolectric (Apache 2.0)\n• Espresso (Apache 2.0)\n• Mockito (MIT)\n• JUnit (EPL 2.0)\n\nFull license texts are available in the project repository.</string>
